    nodeKey: oracle_chamber
    unlockKey: 
    chargeSpell: {fileID: 0}
    chargeCount: 1
    minRegard: 0
    price: 400
    flavour: Someone wrote down what the walls hear. The margins argue with the text.
    isCatchUp: 0
  - id: bk_consecrant
    displayName: Codex of Consecrant Masonry
    type: 1
    pattern: {fileID: 0}
    nodeKey: tech.consecrant_masonry
    unlockKey: 
    chargeSpell: {fileID: 0}
    chargeCount: 1
    minRegard: 0
    price: 220
    flavour: Church stonework, annotated by someone who meant to unbuild it. The
      binding is iron - the requirement travels with the book.
    isCatchUp: 0
  - id: bk_halls_of_war
    displayName: On Halls of War
    type: 1
    pattern: {fileID: 0}
    nodeKey: tech.halls_of_war
    unlockKey: 
    chargeSpell: {fileID: 0}
    chargeCount: 1
    minRegard: 0
    price: 400
    flavour: A drill-master's treatise on rooms that make soldiers. Bloodstains where
      the good chapters start.
    isCatchUp: 0
  - id: bk_psalter
    displayName: Psalter of the Shambling Dead
    type: 1
